        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued September 24 at 1:06PM CDT until September 24 at 2:00PM CDT by NWS Amarillo TX</headline>
        <description>SVRAMA

The National Weather Service in Amarillo has issued a

* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...
Southwestern Collingsworth County in the Panhandle of Texas...
Southeastern Donley County in the Panhandle of Texas...

* Until 200 PM CDT.

* At 106 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located over Memphis,
moving northeast at 25 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Minor damage to roofs, siding, and trees is possible.

* Locations impacted include...
Wellington and Quail.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.

Torrential rainfall is occurring with this storm, and may lead to
flash flooding. Do not drive your vehicle through flooded roadways.</instruction>
